m;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260324/202603240119582727_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260324/202603240119582727_720.jpg"> </div><p>德天空记者Florian Plettenberg消息，桑乔确定赛季后离开曼联，多特有意引进。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-23/69c1623160e29native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">回应皇马传闻，恩佐：我们没有任何谈判，世界杯之后再说吧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250811/68999cf8ccca2.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250811/68999cf8ccca2.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250811/68999cf8ccca2.jpg"> </div><p>切尔西中场恩佐最近一段时间和皇马传出绯闻，在接受媒体采访时，他对这样的传闻进行了回应。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-24/69c173d99ae82native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿斯：恩佐的梦想是身披皇马战袍，成为这家豪门的传奇球星</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260105/695b4e9657781.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260105/695b4e9657781.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260105/695b4e9657781.jpg"> </div><p>阿斯报记者Eduardo Burgos撰文，讨论近期的恩佐离队传闻。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-24/69c1753a76764native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">仅此一位，格林伍德是本赛季至今五大联赛唯一单场大四喜的球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260221/699925bcc79aa.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260221/699925bcc79aa.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260221/699925bcc79aa.jpg"> </div><p>据StatMuse FC数据统计，马赛前锋格林伍德是本赛季至今五大联赛唯一单场上演大四喜的球员。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-24/69c17d7f1a3d3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">切尔西下任主帅赔率：费利佩·路易斯最热门，哈维、小法在列</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260303/69a68e3daba6a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260303/69a68e3daba6a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260303/69a68e3daba6a.jpg"> </div><p>遭遇各项赛事4连败后，切尔西主帅罗塞尼尔的帅位不稳，尤其在可能无缘欧冠资格的情况下。在目前情况下，费利佩·路易斯被认为是接替罗塞尼尔的热门人选。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-24/69c17ded00413native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">贝尔纳尔：我的偶像是梅西+MSN组合很梦幻 巴萨全队坚信能赢欧冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.42" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260324/202603240153239048.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.42" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.42" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260324/202603240153239048.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260324/202603240153239048.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨球员贝尔纳尔接受了《每日体育报》的专访，分享了伤愈复出的艰辛、入选国家队的喜悦以及对未来的展望。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-24/69c1929f6b832native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">解约金1亿！世体：卡萨多收到沙特重磅报价 赛季结束他将决定未来</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250826/68adcf982fa4a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250826/68adcf982fa4a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250826/68adcf982fa4a.jpg"> </div><p>《世界体育报》消息，巴萨中场马克·卡萨多已被沙特联盯上，后者有意在明年夏天砸重金将其签下。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-24/69c19b66ef0d0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">克洛普：皇马没给我打过电话，一次都没有；总得先打个电话吧！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260304/69a7de005fa7c.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260304/69a7de005fa7c.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260304/69a7de005fa7c.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">在一场magenta TV的新闻发布会上，克洛普与穆勒、马茨・胡梅尔斯同台亮相，并以强硬的态度驳斥了与皇马及德国国家队的相关传闻。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-24/69c1a152aef19native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">维尼修斯嘲讽西蒙尼：他们要把我卖掉了，哈哈，他们要把我卖掉了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.79" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260324/202603240638036058.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.79" style="widt